WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.939 --> 00:00:11.769
It is the webpage at this URL, and it was formed through a combination

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:20.460
the 25 all-time, top, most useful, highest rated life pro tips of Reddit.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.878
And I thought that I could make it a smidge easier to learn those top 25 ways to make your life better.

00:00:25.878 --> 00:00:29.188
#1 top tip: write down all the nice things that happened to you over the year,

00:00:29.188 --> 00:00:32.468
fold them up, put them into a jar, and then New Year's, dump them out,

00:00:32.468 --> 00:00:35.954
and remember all the nice times that we all too often forget.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:41.020
#2: camping, but your headlamp is too weirdly bright but not bright enough

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:43.403
cause it's unidirectional and not ambient?

00:00:43.403 --> 00:00:46.916
Strap it to a water bottle and turn it on. Yeah. Whaaat?

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:48.578
It's nice, right? That's pleasant!

00:00:48.578 --> 00:00:52.298
White text with a black outline can be read on any color.

00:00:52.298 --> 00:00:54.719
The Alien Blue app is an excellent way to browse Reddit on your phone.

00:00:54.719 --> 00:00:57.872
Tap with two fingers for an upvote, three fingers for downvote.

00:00:57.872 --> 00:01:01.936
Tired of coworkers stealing your pen? Take your blue or black cartridge

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:06.780
out of your blue or black pen, and put in into a pen with a froofy color,

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.200
cause nobody steals pink pens!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:12.856
When browsing for plane tickets, use your browser's incognito mode!

00:01:12.856 --> 00:01:15.752
Stupid travel websites, if you don't buy the first time, will raise the price

00:01:15.752 --> 00:01:19.676
if they see you come back a second time cause they know that you're more likely to buy it. Jerks!

00:01:19.676 --> 00:01:22.758
Having a hard time untying a knot? Twist the thing that the knot is made out of

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:26.780
to compress it, and then it will be easier to push it through.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:29.678
It's not actually as useful as the pro tip makes it sound.

00:01:29.678 --> 00:01:34.130
Other things I saw in the comments: if you bang on or bite a knot, that will help loosen it as well,

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:40.080
Who has CD cases lying around anymore? But if you need one, you can make one out of a sheet of paper.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:42.304
A little bit of Scotch tape for extra security, though.

00:01:42.304 --> 00:01:44.757
Got a container you need to fill with water but it's too big to fit in the sink?

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.320
Dustpan. Yeah!

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:50.915
There's a stupid hole in my stupid dustpan, so I have to use duct tape, which is like life pro tip #1, right?

00:01:50.915 --> 00:01:55.908
VLC is an amazing piece of software that lets you watch pretty much any movie format ever.

00:01:55.908 --> 00:02:01.308
Also, it has a mixer inside; if the dialogue is too quiet and the action is too loud, you can mix it!

00:02:01.308 --> 00:02:03.560
Good eggs sink; bad eggs float.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:07.687
Add "/zip" to the end of any Imgur album, and you get the whole album downloaded as a ZIP file.

00:02:07.687 --> 00:02:08.520
So awesome!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.385
Save your fingernails! Use a staple remover to open up a keyring.

00:02:11.385 --> 00:02:18.100
We all know Ctrl+ or Cmd+V pastes, but Ctrl+Shift+V pastes without formatting.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:18.700
What?

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.940
Fill your water bottle up quarter-way with water and throw it in the freezer.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:25.079
Then, whenever you want, just fill it up all the way. You got ice-cold water to go.

00:02:25.079 --> 00:02:27.379
If one of your old cables is in danger of snapping,

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.139
you can use the spring from an old ballpoint pen to reinforce it.

00:02:30.139 --> 00:02:34.812
If you wanna cool down your beverage without watering it down, you can throw in some frozen grapes.

00:02:34.812 --> 00:02:37.546
Rub a walnut on damaged wood to cover up dings.

00:02:37.546 --> 00:02:42.057
And I don't know who cares so much about their dinged furniture. I don't have any examples of that.

00:02:42.057 --> 00:02:42.557
I—

00:02:42.557 --> 00:02:44.417
Walnuts— eat them. They're food.

00:02:44.417 --> 00:02:49.777
Make amazing ramen with this extraordinarily detailed infographic that's linked in the description.

00:02:49.777 --> 00:02:53.157
Put a rubber band around your paint can so that you have something to wipe your paintbrush off

00:02:53.157 --> 00:02:55.017
that's not the side of the can; it just gets all messy then.

00:02:55.017 --> 00:02:59.657
Get more out of Google with this other extraordinarily detailed infographic that's linked in the description.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:05.320
Forward spam texts to 7726; all carriers will then use that information to track down the spammers.

00:03:05.329 --> 00:03:09.249
And finally, if you find yourself in an emergency, do not say, "Somebody call 911!"

00:03:09.249 --> 00:03:13.860
Either call 911 yourself, or tell a specific person to call 911.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.900
Otherwise, and this has happened, everyone assumes someone has already done it. Which is terrible.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:22.060
Thanks to all the original posters; make sure that you go check those out because usually, with Reddit posts,

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:24.140
the comments are better than the original post anyway.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.485
Check out the LifeProTips subreddit; it's a great way to spend time,

00:03:26.485 --> 00:03:29.765
and also the nerdfighters subreddit is a pretty cool way to spend time.

00:03:29.765 --> 00:03:31.636
And John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

